 "description": "One call for the pair every bot needs after sending: the transaction plus its receipt, with confirmations, block, status, gas used and revert reason together \u2014 instead of two paid reads and a race. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/tx-status?chain=base&hash=0x55bd09129b86846556030b6036d48c75865b1f8e73ee6f7df60a22a56f3cd0d4.",
